      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BLANKET GAME (1) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Paw Lester (23.97) in a Grade 5. Settled off speed and worked to the line nicely. The form from his last run stacks up well. Expected to feature in the finish again. DRAX BALE (2) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 0.7 lengths at this track in a handy 23.64 beating Artemis Science. One of the leading chances again. PERFECT TONIGHT (8) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing fourth (22.57) at Warrnambool in a Grade 5. Can feature with the right run. LEKTRA ROGER (7) is in the mix despite missing out at this track last time.",
